# 02 - Strudel + Hydra synced on Kanopi's transport. Audio actor drives
# the clock; visual actor reads `beat` and `bar` from the same clock.
#
# How to play it:
#   1. Open `02-drums.strudel`, put the cursor in the `s(...)` block, Ctrl+Enter.
#      You hear a 4-on-the-floor kick + hats. The transport starts on the
#      first eval.
#   2. Open `02-moire.hydra`, put the cursor in the `osc(...)` block, Ctrl+Enter.
#      Visuals appear and pulse on every quarter note - the `beat` and `bar`
#      identifiers in the patch are kept in sync by the Hydra adapter.
#   3. Press Ctrl+. to hush both at once - one keybinding stops every runtime.

@actor groove 02-drums.strudel strudel
@actor viz    02-moire.hydra   hydra
@scene main groove viz
